\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Financial Services News of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 677 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 2015\par 22:17\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par FINANCIAL SERVICES TOP STORIES \par  \par ARREST WARRANTS ISSUED IN FRANCE FOR 3 FORMER \f28 \uc2 \f2 UBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  EXECUTIVES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 French prosecutors have issued arrest warrants for three former \f28 \uc2 \f2 UBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  executives, as part of an ongoing probe into whether the Swiss bank helped wealthy French customers evade taxes. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BATS PLANS TO PROMOTE CONCANNON TO CEO \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BATS Global Markets\f28 \uc2 \f2 , one of the country's three big stock-exchange operators, is preparing to replace its chief executive as it lays the groundwork for restarting an IPO, according to people familiar with the matter. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 CAIXABANK\f28 \uc2 \f2  LAUNCHES TAKEOVER BID FOR \f28 \uc2 \f2 BANCO BPI\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Caixabank\f28 \uc2 \f2  launched a takeover bid for the 55.9% of Portuguese lender \f28 \uc2 \f2 Banco BPI\f28 \uc2 \f2  that it doesn't already own, as the Spanish lender seeks to become the dominant bank across the Iberian Peninsula. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CHINA DEVELOPMENT BANK PLANS IPO FOR LEASING UNIT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China Development Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  is planning to raise between US$1 billion and US$1.5 billion from a Hong Kong IPO of its leasing unit sometime this year, a source said, as the policy bank capitalizes on Asia's growing demand for aircraft. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CFTC TO PROPOSE SWAPS ANONYMITY \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. regulators are poised to introduce measures that would ensure anonymity for traders in the $700 trillion market for swaps, said people familiar with the discussions, a flip-flop that would hand a victory to hedge funds and speedy trading firms while dealing a blow to banks. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par FXCM TO STOP TRADING IN SELECTED \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  broker FXCM will stop trading a number of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  later this week to avoid volatility caused by possible future \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by governments in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, according to a person familiar with the matter. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ECONOMIST PETER BLAIR HENRY TO JOIN \f28 \uc2 \f2 CITIGROUP'S BOARD\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Citigroup\f28 \uc2 \f2  said that economist Peter Blair Henry would join the bank's board of directors this summer. Henry, the dean of New York University's Stern School of Business, is an authority on emerging-market economies. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par SNB READY TO CURB ANY FRANC STRENGTHENING \par  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Switzerland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remains ready to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets to curb any strengthening of the franc, Swiss National Bank President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thomas Jordan\f28 \uc2 \f2  said, adding the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remains "significantly overvalued." \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par MCGEE, WHO OVERSAW TURNAROUND AT HARTFORD, DIES AT 60 \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Liam E. McGee\f28 \uc2 \f2 , who oversaw a turnaround of struggling \f28 \uc2 \f2 Hartford Financial Services Group\f28 \uc2 \f2  after the financial crisis of 2008, died Friday following a battle with cancer that had prompted his retirement as the Connecticut company's president and chief executive last year. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CHINA HAD CAPITAL OUTFLOWS IN JANUARY \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite a record trade surplus and a steady inflow of investment capital, China's banks posted net sales of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in January, suggesting that capital was flowing out of the country during the month. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BANKRUPTCY COURT SHIELDS CALEDONIAN BANK'S U.S. ASSETS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Cayman Islands' Caledonian Bank won a temporary restraining order from a bankruptcy court in New York, heading off a "race to the courthouse" by depositors attempting to claim their cash from U.S. accounts. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ANBANG TO BUY $1 BILLION STAKE IN SOUTH KOREAN LIFE INSURER \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Anbang Insurance Group\f28 \uc2 \f2  of China is buying a controlling stake in South Korean life insurer \f28 \uc2 \f2 Tong Yang Life Insurance\f28 \uc2 \f2  for $1 billion, the latest acquisition abroad for the aggressively expanding Chinese insurer. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CANADA'S \f28 \uc2 \f2 FAIRFAX FINANCIAL\f28 \uc2 \f2  TO BUY U.K. INSURER BRIT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Canadian insurance giant \f28 \uc2 \f2 Fairfax Financial Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2  said late Monday that it has struck a deal to acquire U.K. specialty insurer Brit in a transaction worth $1.88 billion. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CONGRESS STARTS ITS OWN TURBOTAX PROBES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Top lawmakers in the House and Senate have begun their own probes into a recent spate of fraudulent tax filings made through \f28 \uc2 \f2 Intuit\f28 \uc2 \f2 's TurboTax, as federal agents try to determine what has happened. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par LLOYD'S STILL TO PAY $1.2 BILLION IN NZ CLAIMS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Insurer and reinsurer Lloyd's said it has no \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  cover in place for the $1.2 billion in claims it still has to settle related to the Christchurch earthquakes.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 February 17, 2015 16:17 ET (21:17 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150217eb2h003gy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
