\par\par \b \uc2 Chile  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 :  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\uc2  Program Working\b0\par\par\uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 2011\par 16:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BASEL, \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--Capital controls and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  undertaken by a number of emerging nations are a by-product of the two-tier growth of the global economy, but they won't change the long-term course of these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the governor of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Chile said Monday.\par \par \uc2 "There is so much tension in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that what we are doing in a way is to stabilize the sharp appreciation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But we won't change the long-term fundamentals...the adjustments will take place," Jose de Gregorio told reporters on the sidelines of a gathering of central bankers in Basel at the Bank for International Settlements.\par \par \uc2 Several emerging countries have imposed capital controls at their borders or \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in order to curb the value of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , pushed up by a surge in foreign capital inflows in search of higher remuneration against a backdrop of record low interest rates in the developed world.\par \par \uc2 At their meeting in Basel, central bankers agreed that these sharp inflows of capital are an issue for emerging markets. De Gregorio said they are a reflection of the "world's dual recovery," with emerging economies experiencing buoyant growth, while more mature ones are only witnessing a subdued pickup in activity.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Chile last week launched a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program in order to tame the peso's appreciation and prevent exports from being stifled.\par \par \uc2 De Gregorio said the program, which will beef up the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, will help make Chile more resilient in the event of an external shock and is also giving the Chilean economy some breathing space to improve its competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 "The program is currently working," he said, adding that the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't targeting a specific level for the peso through the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 France, which currently heads the Group of 20 industrialized and emerging economies, argues erratic capital flows can create \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility and disrupt the monetary policies of emerging countries. It wants the group to explore ways to better regulate them.\par \par \uc2 While De Gregorio said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would consider any measure to further help stabilizing the Chilean economy, he stressed there was no need at the moment to expand the market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program or to use any other policy tools. He added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program will be assessed on an ongoing basis, and vowed it won't compromise the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation target.\par \par \uc2 The program is designed in such a way "that we feel independent to move our interest rates as needed to fulfil our inflation objectives," De Gregorio told reporters.\par \par \uc2 -By Nathalie Boschat, Dow Jones Newswires; +33 (0) 1 40 17 17 45; nathalie.boschat@dowjones.com [ 01-10-11 1155ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020110110e71a000dq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
