\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Profit from \uc2 UBS\uc2  assets, gold limit SNB's H1 loss\b0\par\par\uc2 462 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 2010\par 07:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  reports 2.8 bln Sfr H1 loss\par \par \uc2  * Gold, \uc2 UBS\uc2  asset fund gains counter some of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses\par \par \uc2  * Makes provisions to pay potential gains from fund to \uc2 UBS\par \par \uc2  (adds details on \uc2 UBS\uc2  fund, background)\par \par \uc2  ZURICH, Aug 13 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  made a loss of 2.8 billion Swiss francs in the first half, less than the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had estimated, as profit from a fund holding assets from bank \uc2 UBS\uc2  balanced some of its hefty \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses.\par \par \uc2  The SNB  said on Friday its overall loss totalled 2.8 billion Swiss francs ($2.65 billion), less than the 4 billion francs estimated in July.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported a loss of 14.3 billion francs on its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, built up through massive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , due to the euro's weakness.\par \par \uc2  However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  booked a profit of 1.3 billion on the fund, which holds toxic assets from \uc2 UBS\uc2  acquired as part of the bailout of Switzerland's largest bank in 2008.\par \par \uc2  The SNB also made a revaluation gain of 6.8 billion francs on its gold reserves of 1,040 tonnes.\par \par \uc2  The SNB said it set aside provisions in its consolidated accounts to cover potential payouts to \uc2 UBS\uc2  from the so-called stabilisation fund.\par \par \uc2  Under the agreement with \uc2 UBS\uc2 , the SNB will get the first 1 billion francs in profits from the fund. Beyond this, \uc2 UBS\uc2  will receive half of the profit, therefore the need for the SNB to make provisions.\par \par \uc2  The overall risk from the fund for the SNB was reduced to $19.2 billion. The SNB originally took over assets worth $39.1 billion as part of the rescue package for \uc2 UBS\uc2 , which ran up over $50 billion in writedowns during the financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 UBS\uc2  officials have indicated in the past that the bank would like to buy the fund back, which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has rejected repeatedly. A SNB spokesman reconfirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's position, saying a sale to \uc2 UBS\uc2  was not on the table.\par \par \uc2  The SNB said in its statement that its half-year result allowed only limited conclusions for the full-year as swings in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , financial and gold prices had a large influence.\par \par \uc2  The SNB has faced some criticism over its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2  where media and economists have raised concerns about losses on the large amounts of euros the SNB has acquired and the effectiveness of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  Traders say that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has already started to diversify its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  portfolio, buying dollars, Canadian and Australian dollars against euros.\par \par \uc2  (Reporting by Sven Egenter; editing by Patrick Graham)  ($1=1.055 Swiss Franc)  \par \par \uc2 SWISS-SNB/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100813e68d000a8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
