\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Swiss  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Reserves Soar To CHF232.4B By End May\b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 2010\par 11:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background, analyst comments.)\par \par \uc2 By Neil MacLucas\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 ZURICH (Dow Jones)--The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves climbed to 232.4 billion Swiss francs ($200.8 billion) by the end of May, according to data published on the Swiss Federal Statistics Office's website.\par \par \uc2 The Swiss \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves increased by CHF78.8 billion last month, from CHF153.6 billion at the end of April, signaling ongoing buying of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the franc's appreciation against the euro.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for the Zurich-based SNB said the data published by the statistics office is provisional and that official data will be released later in June.\par \par \uc2 "This is a clear indication the SNB was in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last month buying euros in a big way," said \uc2 Commerzbank\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst Antje Praefcke.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in recent months to curb an excessive appreciation of the franc against the euro, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its main trade partner.\par \par \uc2 At 0935 the Swiss franc was quoted at 1.3790 against the euro, after earlier climbing to a record high of 1.3785 per euro.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bfs.admin.ch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bfs.admin.ch}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Neil MacLucas, Dow Jones Newswires; +41 43 443 8046;\par \par \uc2 neil.maclucas@dowjones.com [ 08-06-10 0944GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100608e668000x6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
