\par\par \b \uc2 Swiss  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Reserves Rise To CHF153.6B At End Apr-Stats Office\b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 2010\par 08:32\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 ZURICH (Dow Jones)-- The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose to 153.6 billion Swiss francs ($133.5 billion) by the end of April, according to data published on the Swiss Federal Statistics Office's website.\par \par \uc2 The SNB's reserves increased by CHF28.7 billion last month, from CHF124.9 billion at the end of March, signaling ongoing buying of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the franc's appreciation.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for the Zurich-based SNB said the data published by the statistics office is provisional and the official data will be published May 21.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in recent months to weaken the franc against the euro, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its main trade partner.\par \par \uc2 "A similar increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings excluding gold should lift Switzerland into the top 10 economies, with respect to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," said UBS AG economist Reto Huenerwadel.\par \par \uc2 "There is little evidence the SNB is to step away from their current monetary policy including \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said.\par \par \uc2 At 0617 GMT, the franc was quoted at 1.4005 against the euro.\par \par \uc2 Company Web Site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bfs.admin.ch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bfs.admin.ch}}}\par \par \uc2 -Zurich Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; +41 43 443 8040;\par \par \uc2 zurichdjnews@dowjones.com [ 19-05-10 0632GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100519e65j000hc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
